                                <p>NFTs have a high market value and their growth is still very
                                    strong. The fractional
                                    NFT
                                    concept is to separate NFTs into different categories or segments that have too much
                                    value. This will have many benefits for the NFT market including high traffic.
                                    Fractional NFT is the most important turning point in NFT and cryptocurrency
                                    markets.
                                    The separation of NFT into smaller pieces will make it more affordable. Transactions
                                    will flow very fast because NFT is one of the most attractive investments.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                                <div class="card h-100">
                                    <div class="card-body p-3">
                                        <h5 class="fc-b">How does Fractionalized NFT Market Work?</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">Non Fungible tokens have token standards that
                                            allow them to
                                            support and preserve the NFT characteristics. If Ethereum is the blockchain,
                                            then the token standard is ERC-721. Or one similar. In fractional NFT, NFTs
                                            can
                                            be locked with smart contracts. The smart contract will then split the NFT
                                            into
                                            different pieces, resulting in ERC-20 tokens. ERC-20 tokens can be fungible,
                                            so
                                            their tokens will not represent ownership of any particular NFT.</p>
                                        <p class="card-text">The Fractional NFT can be bought by the buyer.
                                            This is an
                                            ERC-721 asset that is divided. You can put this up for sale in different
                                            types.
                                            They can either set a time limit for the token to be sold or allow them to
                                            remain on the market until the last one is sold. Fractional NFT will be
                                            traded
                                            and staked in the Fractional NFT Marketplace, which has brought about many
                                            revolutionary changes in traditional NFT marketplaces.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
